        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WTFBI, Warwick Pre-Drilled Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>This item is are on long-term backorder from the manufacturer. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for availability.</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Warwick Rough Iron Handleset is made to fit pre-drilled doors. This Warwick Entry Set is forged in black iron. The rough iron finish duplicates that found on the ironwork of many old European castles and cathedrals by imitating the natural weathering of iron. It's made by Acorn, which means the WTFBI handleset will last for many years of use and add old world charm to your home. Its decorative style is great indoors or outdoors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a knob from the exterior and interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Warwick Rough Iron Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Texture Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Length:15\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" latches included.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-Keyway</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. This door push plate is handmade and all dimensions are approximate.</i>\r\n</p>",
